== Icelandic ==
{{Is-Numeral(tveir)|tuttugu og }}
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[tveir]]'' "[[two]]". Meaning '''twenty and two'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''tuttugu og tveir''' {{indecl}}

